# This directory is documentation, not a stow package.
#
# `task sync` globs every top-level */ and stows it, so without this file
# stow would link each runbook straight into $HOME (~/hyprland-brightness.md).
# There is no $HOME-relative tree in here to deploy — the content is meant to
# be read in the repo.
#
# One regex per line, implicitly anchored. `.*` matches every entry, so stow
# descends into this package and finds nothing to link.
.*
